<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107214" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεραιωρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suspend</i> or <i>support above,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακεκλιμένος ὑπὸ δένδρων παντοίας
					ὑπεραιωρούντων χάριτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1.53
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.103
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hold up, raise,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κεφαλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CD</u>
					1.3
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, of the overlapping end of a dislocated bone, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεραιωρεῖσθαι τὴν κεφαλὴν τοῦ μηροῦ ὑπὲρ
				τῆς κοτύλης</span>
			<i>to be lifted</i> or <i>drawn over,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				70
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ὑπὲρ τῆς ἀρχαίης
			ἕδρης</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				71
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fract.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				41
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Art.</u>
				22
			</span></i>: Littré (following <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
			</span></i> Cit.) gives the 
				Act.
			 in same sense, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Art.</u>
				73
			</span></i>; and so in the Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεραιμ-αιώρησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, αἱ ἐξ ὑ. [ἐμβολαί</span>] ib.<i><span class="en">
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mochl.</u>
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in nautical
			language, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεραιωρηθῆναι</span> c. gen.
			loci, <i>lie off</i> a place, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇσι νηυσὶ ὑπεραιωρηθέντες Φαλήρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.116
				</span></i>
			.</div>
